# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything below is either a secret, a local
# artefact, or noise that would only mislead someone reading the repo.

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated by scripts/rehearse.sh and scripts/preview.sh: Postgres passwords
# and SECRET_KEY_BASE. Patterns as well as the bare name, so a future harness
# that invents .env.something is covered by default rather than by remembering.
.env
.env.*
*.env

# The deployable app spec, once the <REPLACE> markers are filled. It carries the
# Postgres password and SECRET_KEY_BASE in environmentParameters, so the filled
# copy is a secret even though deploy/flux/explorer-app-spec.json is not. Same
# pattern and same reason as quip-ipfs-node's deploy/flux/quipipfs.filled.json.
deploy/flux/*.filled.json

# Never belongs in this repo. The deployment gets its certificate from Flux's
# FDM, so there is no legitimate reason for key material to appear here. This
# is a backstop against a stray copy, not part of any workflow.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── Local artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rehearsal measurement output. The whole directory rather than named files:
# the sampler's outputs change as it does, and a new output should not become a
# tracked artefact by accident.
rehearsal/

# Working docs — local-only, never committed. Matches every sibling infra repo:
# bootnodes, status, check, pad, meet, flux-dns-controller, depin-images and
# faucet all track ZERO files under docs/. Durable operational documentation
# belongs in README.md, which is where bootnodes keeps its own. quip-validator
# is the sole exception that tracks docs/, and it is not an infra repo.
docs/

# scripts/send-test-transaction.mjs needs ethers, which is deliberately NOT a
# dependency of this repo — it is run from a scratch directory. If someone
# installs it here instead, keep the result out of the tree.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

*.log

# ── Editor and OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
